{{also|'specially}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|specialli}}, {{m|enm|specially}}, equivalent to {{suf|en|special|ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈspɛʃəli/}}
* {{hyph|en|spe|cial|ly}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-specially.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# For a [[special]] purpose.
#: {{ux|en|We had this cake made '''specially''' for your birthday.}}
# {{lb|en|proscribed}} [[extremely]]
#: {{ux|en|She's '''specially''' good at running.}}
# {{lb|en|proscribed}} [[in particular]]
#: {{ux|en|I love all animals, '''specially''' cute furry ones.}}

====Usage notes====
* Senses 2 and 3 are non-standard; in such cases, {{m|en|especially}} is far more common, and considered correct.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|for a special purpose}}
* {{sense|extremely}} {{l|en|exceedingly}}, {{l|en|passing}}, {{l|en|quite}}; see also [[Thesaurus:very]]
* {{sense|in particular}} see also [[Thesaurus:specifically]]

